 Auto Blackflash Chain / Auto Aim
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Deobfuscated, bug-fixed and cleaned up. All in-game remote paths, animation
 IDs and the aim/arc math are unchanged from the original so behaviour is
 identical; only readability, robustness and the UI were improved.

 New / improved:
   * Master enable toggle (turn everything off without unloading).
   * "Reset to Defaults" button that also refreshes every field live.
   * Target Distance limit for the nearest-enemy search (0 = unlimited).
   * RightShift keybind to show/hide the whole UI.
   * Live camera reference (survives respawns / camera swaps).
   * Numeric fields are clamped so you can't type nonsense values.
--]]

